## Maintainer identity and copyright

NefaroXX (https://github.com/NefaroXX) is the public pseudonym of Concerto's
individual maintainer and identifies the copyright holder for that
individual's own copyrightable contributions.

Earlier notices used "NefaroXX / MIT Services". MIT Services was the same
individual's unregistered trading name, not a separate company or additional
copyright holder. Using "NefaroXX" alone clarifies that identity; it does not
transfer copyright or change the permissions granted for earlier versions.

Other contributors and third-party authors retain their respective rights.
Contributing under the licenses above does not, by itself, assign copyright
to the maintainer. This identity clarification adds no license conditions.
